+
+- Rounds without usage are skipped when summing, and a turn with no reported usage passes `undefined` to the hook ([validated by: counts reported rounds while leaving a turn with no reported usage undefined](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestratorUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L67)).
