+# Provider Usage Arithmetic
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#93 |
+| Status | Shipped              |
+
+Combining two reported provider usages adds their input, output, and total token fields independently, retaining provider-reported totals rather than deriving them from input and output ([validated by: sums each reported token field across two provider calls](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.test.ts#L4)).
+
+Missing provider usage leaves the accumulated total unchanged, a first reported round starts the total, and a turn with no reported usage remains undefined ([validated by: ignores missing usage before, between, and after reported rounds](../../src/orchestration/turnUsageMissing.test.ts#L4)).
